Quota Floater
=============

This product is Quota Floater. It is not the upstream desktop app.

Third-party probes
------------------

`vendor/tm-shared/` contains standalone quota probe modules taken from:

    https://github.com/Javis603/token-monitor

Copyright (c) 2026 Javis

Those files are MIT. Full text: `vendor/tm-shared/LICENSE`.

Thanks to Javis603/token-monitor for the official remaining-quota probes.
Quota Floater reuses those modules. It does not log in, open that app's
Settings panel, or copy secrets into git.
